                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8bf5c23-1781-49b0-b99a-cb8f9a239daf",
                                "sense_id": "20026f59-6e20-3158-afd4-28088565b805",
                                "text": "To one like Elia, whose treasures are rather cased in leather covers, than closed in iron coffers, there is a class of alienators more formidable than that which I have touched upon; I mean, your borrowers of books—those mutilators of collections, spoilers of the symmetry of shelves, and creators of odd volumes."
